       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SQTCREAT.
       AUTHOR.        BARBARA WINTER.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  APRIL  1987.
      *INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.

      *REMARKS.
      *D QUOTE CREATE SCREEN PROGRAM.
      ******************************************************************
      ******************************************************************
      *                      S Q T C R E A T                           *
      * THIS SCREEN PROGRAM IS THE BEGINNING OF THE PROCESS PERFORMED  *
      * TO CREATE A QUOTE.  THE SCREEN IS DISPLAYED AND UP TO 10       *
      * VENDORS WITH CORPORATE CODES MAY BE ENTERED.                   *
      * THE CORPORATE CODES ARE WRITTEN TO A FILE (SEPARATE FILES FOR  *
      * FOR CODED AND NONCODED) AND THEN A JOBSTREAM IS                *
      * KICKED OFF TO RUN XQTSTORE.OBJECT TO ACTUALLY SORT AND STORE   *
      * THE QUOTE.  XQTSTORE.OBJECT WILL IN TURN CALL THE PRINT        *
      * ROUTINE.                                                       *
      ******************************************************************
      *C     6/04/94  MARVIN MITCHELL REQUEST #94-017
      *C     ADDED TWO MORE PRINTER OPTIONS FOR PRINTING QUOTES,
      *C     AND LOGIC THAT CHECKS FOR A VALID SELECTION.
      *C
      *C     8/08/94  MARVIN MITCHELL
      *C     CHANGED ALL REFERENCES TO COPYMMIS/COPYCSIS TO COPYLIB.
      *C
      *C     5/03/95  WILL MCINTYRE   REQUEST #95-007
      *C     ADDED CALL TO TALTVENK TO ALLOW USER TO ENTER AN
      *C     ALTERNATE KEY, AND HAVE THE LINKED VENDOR CODE
      *C     SUBSTITUTED IN THE ALTERNATE KEY'S PLACE.
      *C
      *C     9/05/96  WILL MCINTYRE
      *C     MADE REVISIONS FOR END OF CENTURY COMPATABILITY.
      *C
      *C     9/24/96  WILL MCINTYRE
      *C     REVISED VENDOR EDIT SO THAT AT LEAST ONE ENTRY IS REQUIRED.
      *C
      *C     02/04/1997  WILL MCINTYRE
      *C     ADD VENDOR CODE INQUIRY HELP SCREEN TO PROGRAM
      *C
      *C     12/17/2002  DAN RAUCH  DCR01
      *C     DON'T ALLOW QUOTE ON ARIBA BUYER REQ'S
      *C     BLOCK BUYER CODE "ARBA" AND MREQ HOLD STATUS = "AR"
      *C
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.  I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT CODE-FILE         ASSIGN TO DISK-DQTCODES.
           SELECT NONCODE-FILE      ASSIGN TO DISK-DQNCODES.
           SELECT STREAM-FILE       ASSIGN TO DISK-DJQUOTES.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZUDCQUOT-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  RELATIVE KEY IS RELATIVE-RECNO
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
DCR01 ***=============================================================
DCR01       SELECT MREQ-FILE   ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2001
DCR01              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
DCR01              ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
DCR01              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
DCR01              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
DCR01 ***=============================================================
            SELECT MBUYER-I
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0601
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT DVENDOR-I
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0701
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
             SELECT DQUOTEXT-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3801
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
             SELECT MSTORERM-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
             SELECT DREQITM-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT MPLTINFO-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC                   PIC X(2000).

       FD  MBUYER-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MBUYER-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0600  OF MCFLCS0601.

       FD  MREQ-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MREQ-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS2001.
           COPY MREQ  IN COPYLIB.

       FD  DVENDOR-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DVENDOR-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0700  OF MCFLCS0701.

       FD  DQUOTEXT-I
