               88  GOOD-CALL                   VALUE 0.
               88  END-OF-FILE                 VALUE 11.
               88  START-OF-CHAIN              VALUE 14.
               88  END-OF-CHAIN                VALUE 15.
               88  NO-ENTRY                    VALUE 17.
           05  DATA-LENGTH               PIC S9(4)             COMP-4.
