       01  REQ-ARG                       PIC X(12)  VALUE SPACES.
       01  QT-STD-ARG                    PIC X(10)  VALUE "STAND     ".
       01  BUYER-ARG                     PIC X(4)   VALUE SPACES.
       01  QUOTE-ARG.
           05  QUOTE-ARG-NUM             PIC X(6)   VALUE SPACES.
